{"concepts":["causal_claim","counterevidence","disruption_identity","observation","signal_identity","source_independence","spatial_overlap","temporal_precedence","warning_posture"],"datasetVersion":"notella-curriculum-v1","family":"v6-development-duplicate-reports","id":"v6-control-duplicate-reports","messages":[{"content":"Use only the supplied typed observation and the trusted proposed policy below. This is a synthetic development task, not an attack probability. Source lineage is supplied by a caller-reviewed registry: distinct_reviewed_origins means different asserted provenance roots, not statistical independence. shared_origin means reports relay one origin. Critical/met/corroborated_drone requires ongoingThreat=true, reviewed_deliberate_disruption, corroborated_drone_identity, distinct_reviewed_origins, equal areaRef, order=after and withinWindow=true. Use high/unconfirmed/unidentified_signal for unidentified_rf. Use high/unconfirmed/cause_unresolved for outage_cause_unknown. Use high/unconfirmed/unknown_time for order=unknown, and high/unconfirmed/uncertain_order for order=uncertain. Use high/unconfirmed/dependent_reports for shared_origin reports. Use contextual/not_met/reversed_sequence for order=before; contextual/not_met/outside_window for order=after and withinWindow=false; contextual/not_met/different_location for different areaRef; contextual/not_met/benign_explanation for verified_maintenance or verified_humanitarian_drone. Verified benign operations negate this specific combined trigger even when temporal linkage exists. Contextual does not remove a separate hazard or standing threat. No output establishes causation, perpetrator identity or a certain attack.\nOntology: {\"concepts\":{\"causal_claim\":\"Requires evidence beyond temporal association; actor attribution is a separate claim.\",\"counterevidence\":\"Benign explanations, reversed order and absent corroboration constrain an interpretation.\",\"disruption_identity\":\"An outage is not sufficient evidence of deliberate denial of service.\",\"observation\":\"A measured or reported event with source, place, time and uncertainty.\",\"signal_identity\":\"Generic RF energy is not confirmed drone identification.\",\"source_independence\":\"Separate reports are not independent when they derive from one observation.\",\"spatial_overlap\":\"Locations overlap within the supplied measurement uncertainty.\",\"temporal_precedence\":\"Event A precedes B only if their uncertainty intervals do not overlap.\",\"warning_posture\":\"Precautionary urgency under a named policy; not probability of attack.\"},\"relations\":[{\"object\":\"causal_claim\",\"predicate\":\"distinctFrom\",\"subject\":\"warning_posture\"},{\"object\":\"observation\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"subject\":\"temporal_precedence\"},{\"object\":\"observation\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"subject\":\"source_independence\"},{\"object\":\"warning_posture\",\"predicate\":\"constrains\",\"subject\":\"counterevidence\"}]}\nReturn JSON matching: {\"additionalProperties\":false,\"enum\":[{\"combinedTrigger\":\"met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"corroborated_drone\",\"posture\":\"critical\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"benign_explanation\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"different_location\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"outside_window\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"reversed_sequence\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"unconfirmed\",\"evidenceClass\":\"cause_unresolved\",\"posture\":\"high\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"unconfirmed\",\"evidenceClass\":\"dependent_reports\",\"posture\":\"high\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"unconfirmed\",\"evidenceClass\":\"uncertain_order\",\"posture\":\"high\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"unconfirmed\",\"evidenceClass\":\"unidentified_signal\",\"posture\":\"high\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"unconfirmed\",\"evidenceClass\":\"unknown_time\",\"posture\":\"high\"}],\"properties\":{\"combinedTrigger\":{\"enum\":[\"met\",\"unconfirmed\",\"not_met\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"evidenceClass\":{\"enum\":[\"corroborated_drone\",\"unidentified_signal\",\"cause_unresolved\",\"reversed_sequence\",\"unknown_time\",\"different_location\",\"benign_explanation\",\"dependent_reports\",\"outside_window\",\"uncertain_order\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"posture\":{\"enum\":[\"critical\",\"high\",\"contextual\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"posture\",\"combinedTrigger\",\"evidenceClass\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"observation\":{\"context\":{\"ongoingThreat\":true},\"disruption\":{\"areaRef\":\"local_area\",\"classification\":\"reviewed_deliberate_disruption\"},\"drone\":{\"areaRef\":\"local_area\",\"classification\":\"unverified_drone_report\",\"sourceLineage\":{\"originGroups\":[0,0,0],\"relationship\":\"shared_origin\",\"reportCount\":3,\"reviewedDistinctOrigins\":1}},\"formatVersion\":\"layertime.decision-observation.v1\",\"time\":{\"configuredWindowMs\":45000,\"delayIntervalMs\":[32500,33500],\"order\":\"after\",\"withinWindow\":true}}}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"combinedTrigger\":\"unconfirmed\",\"evidenceClass\":\"dependent_reports\",\"posture\":\"high\"}","role":"assistant"}],"outputSchema":"{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"enum\":[{\"combinedTrigger\":\"met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"corroborated_drone\",\"posture\":\"critical\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"benign_explanation\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"different_location\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"outside_window\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"not_met\",\"evidenceClass\":\"reversed_sequence\",\"posture\":\"contextual\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"unconfirmed\",\"evidenceClass\":\"cause_unresolved\",\"posture\":\"high\"},{\"combinedTrigger\":\"unconfirmed\